Normalization in Oracle (1NF, 2NF, 3NF, 4NF, 5NF) using Functional Dependencies

EXPECTED OUTPUT / RESULT

The final normalized design consists of:
1NF: StudentCourse_1NF with atomic values and one row per (SID, Course).
2NF: Student, Course_Faculty, and Enrollment.
3NF: Department, Faculty_Dept, and Course_3NF.
4NF: Faculty_Course and Faculty_Language.
5NF: Faculty_Course_5NF, Course_Textbook_5NF, and Faculty_Textbook_5NF.

